{"id":"724d38bcb2abeb43","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-truth-teller.md","title":"保留句法的真理陈述者","display":"df-truth-teller — 保留句法的真理陈述者","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-truth-teller","aliases":["91-df-truth-teller","91-df-truth-teller-sentence"],"display":"df-truth-teller — 保留句法的真理陈述者","depends_on":["[[91-df-coded-syntax]]","[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-truth-teller"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-truth-teller</span><span>91-df-truth-teller-sentence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-truth-teller — 保留句法的真理陈述者"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"38c875c58a0bf84c\" href=\"?note=38c875c58a0bf84c\" title=\"91-df-coded-syntax\">91-df-coded-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ec1d9c6fcc3c0767\" href=\"?note=ec1d9c6fcc3c0767\" title=\"91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth\">91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 是由句法递归定理取得的闭项，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash t=\\overline{\\ulcorner T(t)\\urcorner}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash t=\\overline{\\ulcorner T(t)\\urcorner}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}teller}\\vdash\\quad\n\\tau\\coloneqq T(t),\\qquad\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\tau\\leftrightarrow T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau\\urcorner}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}teller}\\vdash\\quad\n\\tau\\coloneqq T(t),\\qquad\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\tau\\leftrightarrow T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau\\urcorner}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TruthTeller}_{S,T}(\\gamma)\\coloneqq\n\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\land S\\vdash[\\gamma\\leftrightarrow T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner})].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TruthTeller}_{S,T}(\\gamma)\\coloneqq\n\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\land S\\vdash[\\gamma\\leftrightarrow T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner})].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>语义分析固定使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=T(t)\">\\(\\tau=T(t)\\)</span>。最小强 Kleene 固定点不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 或其否定；另有一致固定点判它真、判它假。\n经典的双条件关系只表述可证自指性质，不是句子的唯一性定义，也不单独保证每个任意经典等价改写具有相同部分语义。</p>\n<p>来源：§15.1，印刷页 191、196，PDF 页 202、207；§5.3 的递归编码方法。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-coded-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"38c875c58a0bf84c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-coded-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth","status":"resolved","id":"ec1d9c6fcc3c0767","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash t=\\overline{\\ulcorner T(t)\\urcorner}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}teller}\\vdash\\quad\n\\tau\\coloneqq T(t),\\qquad\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\tau\\leftrightarrow T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau\\urcorner}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TruthTeller}_{S,T}(\\gamma)\\coloneqq\n\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\land S\\vdash[\\gamma\\leftrightarrow T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner})].","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau=T(t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false}],"bytes":1258,"backlinks":[{"id":"8e63bca271dfc8f1","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\tau=T(t)$ 为 [[91-df-truth-teller]] 的标准闭项构造。"},{"id":"5349915a17c515d9","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-30","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-teller]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-64","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-teller]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-108","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-coded-syntax.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-expressive-completeness.md]]\n[[91-df-external-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-external-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-external-negation.md]]\n[[91-df-extrinsic-fixed-point.md]]\n[[91-df-fixed-point-model.md]]\n[[91-df-gap-sentence.md]]\n[[91-df-global-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-global-reflection.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-language.m